ent-top"><div class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="visit_luncheonette-feature_logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e305638ce40a0f0af305e3/6806a9feaa6acbea1f607a39_luncheonette-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Woolworth&#x27;s Luncheonette" class="visit_luncheonette-feature_logo"/></div></div><div class="text-align-center"><p class="heading-style-h6 text-color-dark-blue">1400 19th St, Suite A, Bakersfield, CA 93301</p></div></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-group is-center"><a href="/luncheonette" class="button is-luncheonette w-button">Learn More</a><div data-w-id="46285c74-0ddf-df4d-1c6f-2b040f380887" class="button is-arrow"><div class="button-arrow_text-wrapper"><div>Order Online</div></div><div class="button-arrow_arrow-wrapper"><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0px, 0px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(-45deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0px, 0px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(-45deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0px, 0px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(-45deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0px, 0px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(-45deg) skew(0, 0)" class="button-arrow_arrow-icon is-arrow-ne w-embed"><svg width="auto" height="auto" viewBox="0 0 14 13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7122 12.5566L6.70763 11.5651L10.8433 7.42945H0.132324L0.132324 5.99436L10.8433 5.99436L6.70763 1.87175L7.7122 0.867187L13.5569 6.71191L7.7122 12.5566Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_visit_faq"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="visit_faq_component"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxlarge"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="max-width-large align-center"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="max-width-large align-center"><div class="visit_faq_list"><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a52" class="faq_question"><div>Where is The Woolworth’s Building located?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper text-color-dark-blue"><div class="icon-embed-small w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>We are located in the heart of downtown Bakersfield, California, at the corner of 19th and K Street. Moneywise is located at 1907 K Street, Bakersfield, CA 93301.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a5c" class="faq_question"><div>What are the building’s hours of operation?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>The Woolworth’s Building is open Monday through Saturday from 11:00 a.m. to 8:00 p.m. We’re closed on Sundays.</p><p class="hide">The building is open to the public Monday – Saturday from 10:30 AM to 10:00 PM.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a66" class="faq_question"><div>Will parking be available?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Yes, both street parking and nearby public lots are available.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a70" class="faq_question"><div>What can I expect to see at The Woolworth’s Building?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Visitors can enjoy:<br/>A meal at the last surviving Woolworth’s Luncheonette, serving classic fare with a modern touch.<br/>Live music, performances, and private events at The Basement, our immersive subterranean venue. The preserved Late Moderne architecture, including terrazzo floors and the original Luncheonette. </p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a80" class="faq_question"><div>Can I take a guided tour of the building?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Yes! Guided tours available upon request. Email inquiries to <a href="mailto:info@historicwoolworths.com" class="text-style-link">info@historicwoolworths.com</a></p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a8a" class="faq_question"><div>Is the building accessible for visitors with disabilities?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Absolutely. The Woolworth’s Building is fully accessible, including elevators for reaching all levels and ADA-compliant restrooms.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a94" class="faq_question"><div>How can I book <strong>The Basement</strong> for private events?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Booking is available now! Email inquiries to <a href="mailto:events@basementatwoolworths.com" target="_blank">events@basementatwoolworths.com</a></p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5a9e" class="faq_question"><div>Is the Luncheonette open daily?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>The Luncheonette is open Monday through Thursday from 11:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m., Friday and Saturday from 11:00 a.m. to 8:00 p.m., and closed on Sundays, along with the rest of the building.</p><p class="hide">The Luncheonette is open Monday – Saturday from 10:30 AM to 10:00 PM.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5aa8" class="faq_question"><div>Are there any special events or performances?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Upcoming special events and performances can be found on The Basement venue website. You can also follow @thebasementatwoolworths on Instagram to see what we’re up to!</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5ab2" class="faq_question"><div>Can I rent space in the building for my business?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Not currently.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5abc" class="faq_question"><div>Is photography allowed?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Personal photography is welcome! For professional shoots, please contact us to obtain the necessary permits.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5ac6" class="faq_question"><div>How do I stay updated on building news and events?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Follow us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/historicwoolworth/?hl=en" target="_blank" class="text-style-link">Instagram</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/historicwoolworth" target="_blank" class="text-style-link">Facebook</a>, or subscribe to our newsletter for the latest updates.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5ad0" class="faq_question"><div>Lost and Found</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>For any inquiries about lost items please email <a href="mailto:info@historicwoolworths.com" class="text-style-link">info@historicwoolworths.com</a></p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5ada" class="faq_question"><div>Where can I buy Woolworths Merchandise?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>Merchandise can be purchased on-site in The Luncheonette.</p></div></div></div><div class="faq_accordion"><div data-w-id="f52ce11f-b337-6abb-edba-d0047a5a5ae4" class="faq_question"><div>Where can I learn more about the history of the building?</div><div class="visit_faq_icon-wrapper"><div class="icon-embed-small text-color-dark-blue w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.5303 20.8839C16.2374 21.1768 15.7626 21.1768 15.4697 20.8839L7.82318 13.2374C7.53029 12.9445 7.53029 12.4697 7.82318 12.1768L8.17674 11.8232C8.46963 11.5303 8.9445 11.5303 9.2374 11.8232L16 18.5858L22.7626 11.8232C23.0555 11.5303 23.5303 11.5303 23.8232 11.8232L24.1768 12.1768C24.4697 12.4697 24.4697 12.9445 24.1768 13.2374L16.5303 20.8839Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></div><div style="width:100%;height:0px" class="faq_answer"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p>We’re glad you asked! Visit the Explore pages our website for a <a href="/history" class="text-style-link">building history timeline</a>, an inside look at <a href="/renovation" class="text-style-link">renovation</a>, and a <a href="/gallery" class="text-style-link">gallery</a> page showcasing all the behind the scenes details.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="margin-top margin-xxlarge"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="max-width-medium align-center"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Still have questions?</h3></div><p>For general inquiries, <a href="/contact" class="text-style-link">contact us</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section_check-pattern"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e305638ce40a0f0af305e3/680680c6d6c5f59f92e1dc44_check_dark-blue.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="check-pattern is-section"/></div></main><footer class="footer_component"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-mega"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xxlarge"><div class="padding-bottom padding-huge"><div class="w-layout-grid footer_top-wrapper"><div class="footer_left-wrapper"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><a href="#" class="footer_logo-link w-nav-brand"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e305638ce40a0f0af305e3/6829104df9165ea00736fcad_w-badge_fill_cool-blue.svg" alt="" class="footer_logo"/></a></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><div>Join our newsletter to stay up to date with all things Woolworth&#x27;s.</div></div><div class="footer_form-block w-form"><form id="wf-form-Footer-Email-Form" name="wf-form-Footer-Email-Form" data-name="Footer Email Form" method="get" class="footer_form" data-wf-page-id="67e42ab85eeed60e2932cf11" data-wf-element-id="576b1cfc-3e8b-28dc-a054-184cd60891d7"><input class="form_